1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,740
W: I must have eaten too much last night at the buffet restaurant because my stomach still feels bloated.

2
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:09,200
I'm just going to settle for coffee this morning.

3
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,680
What are you going to have?

4
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:11,940
M: I am starved.

5
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,300
I am going to order the continental breakfast.

6
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,960
W: Wow, you really do have an appetite, don't you?

7
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:23,425
I mean, I don't understand how you can eat as much as you do yet keep yourself so thin like that.

8
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:24,500
You are so lucky.

9
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:28,580
M: Well, I guess I have always digested my food very fast.

10
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:31,060
I've been thin for as long as I can remember.

11
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,100
Actually, when I was younger, my wish was to gain some weight.

12
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:41,040
In fact, I remember eating 5 meals a day during high school just to gain some weight, but I didn't have any luck.
